# Trivy ignore file
# Document the rationale for each suppressed finding.

# CVE-2026-30242: SSRF in Plane webhook URL serializer.
# Was a false positive: Trivy matched our backend's distribution name "Plane" +
# its old pyproject.toml version (0.24.0) against the makeplane/plane CVE
# ("fixed in 1.2.3"). pyproject.toml now tracks the repo release version, so the
# match should no longer trigger; the entry is kept as a safeguard until a scan
# confirms it. The SSRF mitigation itself is in plane/utils/url_security.py and
# plane/utils/ip_address.py.
CVE-2026-30242
